        "Content": "<ul><li>Features & Services:</li><li></li><li>** This development has a buyer age restriction of 55 years and over. </li><li></li><li> Well-appointed 2 bedroom, 2 bath garden level apartment. </li><li> Extending to 66.71sqm / 718sq.ft. approx.</li><li> Set in an exclusive development.</li><li> Quiet, secure and peaceful setting.</li><li> Located in the heart of Shankill within easy walking access to shops, cafes and transport links.</li><li> Well managed and maintained development.</li><li> Communal grounds and parking.</li><li> Excellent transport links including Bus, Rail and Road.</li><li> Electric Storage Heating.</li><li> Lift access; intercom system.</li><li> Mains water & sewerage.</li><li> 2026 Management Fee: 2,487.24</ul>"
